    {
      "source": "Customization hook to configure the <a href=\"../../util/TypeContributor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeContributor</code></a> used to register the given type.",
      "translation": "自定义钩子，用于配置用于注册给定类型的<a href=\"../../util/TypeContributor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeContributor</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Customization hook to configure <a href=\"../../util/TypeCollector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeCollector</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自定义钩子，用于配置<a href=\"../../util/TypeCollector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeCollector</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Register type-specific hints and AOT artifacts for domain types, reachable types, projection interfaces derived\nfrom query method return types, and annotations from org.springframework.data packages.",
      "translation": "为领域类型、可达类型、由查询方法返回类型派生的投影接口以及来自 org.springframework.data 包的注解注册特定类型的提示和 AOT 工件。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows for the creation to be overridden by subclasses.",
      "translation": "此方法允许子类重写该创建过程。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "With <a href=\"#registerRepositoryCompositionHints(org.springframework.data.repository.config.AotRepositoryContext,org.springframework.aot.generate.GenerationContext)\"><code>registerRepositoryCompositionHints(AotRepositoryContext, GenerationContext)</code></a> (specifically\n<a href=\"#configureTypeContribution(java.lang.Class,org.springframework.data.aot.AotContext)\"><code>configureTypeContribution(Class, AotContext)</code></a> and <a href=\"#contributeAotRepository(org.springframework.data.repository.config.AotRepositoryContext)\"><code>contributeAotRepository(AotRepositoryContext)</code></a>,\nstores can provide custom logic for contributing additional (e.g. reflection) configuration. By default, reflection\nconfiguration will be added for types reachable from the repository declaration and query methods as well as all used\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>annotations</code></a> from the org.springframework.data namespace.",
      "translation": "通过<a href=\"#registerRepositoryCompositionHints(org.springframework.data.repository.config.AotRepositoryContext,org.springframework.aot.generate.GenerationContext)\"><code>registerRepositoryCompositionHints(AotRepositoryContext, GenerationContext)</code></a>（具体而言是<a href=\"#configureTypeContribution(java.lang.Class,org.springframework.data.aot.AotContext)\"><code>configureTypeContribution(Class, AotContext)</code></a>和<a href=\"#contributeAotRepository(org.springframework.data.repository.config.AotRepositoryContext)\"><code>contributeAotRepository(AotRepositoryContext)</code></a>），存储库可以提供自定义逻辑以贡献额外的（例如反射）配置。默认情况下，将为从存储库声明和查询方法可达的类型以及所有使用的来自 org.springframework.data 命名空间的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>注解</code></a>添加反射配置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Processes <a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>repository factory beans</code></a> to provide generic type information to the\nAOT tooling to allow deriving target type from the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>bean definition</code></a>. If generic types do\nnot match due to customization of the factory bean by the user, at least the target repository type is provided via\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html#OBJECT_TYPE_ATTRIBUTE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean.OBJECT_TYPE_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "处理 <a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>仓库工厂 Bean</code></a>，以向 AOT 工具提供泛型类型信息，从而能够从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>Bean 定义</code></a> 推导出目标类型。如果由于用户自定义工厂 Bean 而导致泛型类型不匹配，则至少通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html#OBJECT_TYPE_ATTRIBUTE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean.OBJECT_TYPE_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> 提供目标仓库类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The processor is typically configured via <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html#getRepositoryAotProcessor()\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension.getRepositoryAotProcessor()</code></a> and\ngets added by the <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "处理器通常通过<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html#getRepositoryAotProcessor()\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension.getRepositoryAotProcessor()</code></a>进行配置，并由<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate</code></a>添加。",
      "count": 2
    },
