      "source": "Setter for the config map. See <code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate#registerAotComponents</code>.",
      "translation": "配置映射的 Setter。参见<code>RepositoryConfigurationDelegate#registerAotComponents</code>。",
      "count": 2
